    {
      "type": "patchouli:entity",
      "entity": "goetied:wraith_servant"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "你可以通过使用$(l:focuses/necromancy/spooky_focus)骇人聚晶$()或一个仪式召唤一个幽灵仆从，后者拥有无限的存续时间"
    },
    {
      "type": "goetied:ritual",
      "recipe": "goetied:thrall/summon_wraith_thrall"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "手持灵质右键你的幽灵仆从可以为其恢复血量"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:entity",
      "advancement": "goetied:goetied/kill_a_muck_wraith",
      "entity": "goetied:muck_wraith_servant"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "advancement": "goetied:goetied/kill_a_muck_wraith",
      "text": "作为一种到处释放酸云的幽灵变种，它会在你试图在沼泽生物群系中召唤幽灵仆从时生成"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:entity",
      "advancement": "goetied:goetied/kill_a_border_wraith",
      "entity": "goetied:border_wraith_servant"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "advancement": "goetied:goetied/kill_a_border_wraith",
      "text": "作为幽灵的变种，这些喷冰的家伙们可以在$(l:world/crypts)墓穴$()中被你召唤出来"
    }
  ]
}